Interviews were transcribed and coded by two raters working independently, and disagreements were settled by discussion. The coding frame followed the categories of the pilot study, with two additions that the pilot had not anticipated at all. Agreement before discussion was substantial across the sample. Each transcript was then summarised in a short structured memo.

